            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lauren"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was my first time making a steamed pudding and personally I thought it was very good. I made two sauces to go with it, one was a vanilla/butter sauce from another pudding recipe, which I thought complimented it well, and the other was chocolate, which I didn't think went so well with it. My family was not as impressed as I was, but I would make it again.",
